      <cbc:Description languageID="ENG">The scope of this contract is divided into service and hardware. The service encompasses tasks such as storage, assembly, welding, installation, and inspection of the divertor components and diagnostic components. The hardware involves the production and/or acquisition of Langmuir probes, Halo current (Rogowski) coils, Thermocouples, Gas injection pipes, Electrical shunts, Diagnostic connectors, Divertor fasteners, Divertor alignment components, Main water pipe caps.</cbc:Description>
